        "comments": [
          "#!/usr/bin/env python3",
          "# Bounded progress survives even an outer timeout; no input is emitted."
        ],
        "lexical_except_grouping_and_commas": [
          [
            3,
            "'Compare an explicit four-predicate helper to each applicable Python source.\\n\\nSmall controls use optimized Python B. String-heavy near-limit inputs use\\nthe frozen structural-facts candidate D as their stronger Python comparator.\\nBoth arms of each pair import exactly the same runtime source. The native arm\\nadds only the qualification adapter; no production selection is made here.\\n'"
